              "text": "Satan",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": A supernatural being whose name indicates he was regarded as the opponent of human beings.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ready to bring an accusation against him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.1",
